WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:37.870
Episode 16

01:38.690 --> 01:40.000
Who is the lady?

01:40.180 --> 01:42.240
She checked in this afternoon as well!

01:42.300 --> 01:43.450
She insisted on checking out

01:43.450 --> 01:44.390
the quality of the food here

01:44.410 --> 01:46.390
before she decided whether to eat here or not.

01:46.410 --> 01:47.650
So I brought your food box

01:47.650 --> 01:48.980
to her to have a look.

01:48.980 --> 01:50.750
I did nothing else.

01:50.770 --> 01:52.810
Why did you pick ours in particular?

01:52.900 --> 01:54.240
Because you live close!

01:54.260 --> 01:55.810
Just the opposite side.

02:00.450 --> 02:02.960
He is alive again!

02:20.980 --> 02:21.880
Your Excellency,

02:21.900 --> 02:23.760
there is no trace left at all.

02:23.780 --> 02:24.910
I just asked the waiter.

02:24.930 --> 02:26.250
The lady has gone.

02:26.420 --> 02:27.680
Is she Si Lili?

02:27.700 --> 02:28.920
Not sure!

02:53.340 --> 02:55.480
It is she without doubt.

02:55.570 --> 02:56.830
What's your source of judgement?

02:56.850 --> 02:58.810
The smell of the Chenguang.

02:59.090 --> 03:00.480
What is that?

03:01.780 --> 03:03.610
A type of incense

03:03.730 --> 03:05.960
that has been used by the Joy Tsin House all the time.

03:05.980 --> 03:07.650
Its smell is enduring

03:07.650 --> 03:09.730
and doesn't fade easily. Have a try!

03:10.900 --> 03:12.560
How do you know that?

03:18.980 --> 03:20.560
It's a technique of hunting

03:21.450 --> 03:23.320
to make judgement according to the fragrance.

03:23.340 --> 03:26.400
That's the basic of hunting.

03:26.930 --> 03:28.900
I mean how do you know

03:28.900 --> 03:31.370
what type of incense the Joy Tsin House uses.

03:33.620 --> 03:35.470
Frankly speaking,

03:35.490 --> 03:36.840
I have also been

03:37.180 --> 03:38.890
to the Joy Tsin House.

03:39.010 --> 03:40.970
But only to enjoy the singing.

03:41.340 --> 03:42.910
Nothing else.

03:42.930 --> 03:44.330
Are you able to hold it?

03:47.980 --> 03:49.370
It's just too expensive there.

03:49.370 --> 03:51.550
I can't afford it,

03:51.570 --> 03:53.480
nor do I have the guts.

03:53.930 --> 03:55.120
Your Excellency,

03:55.140 --> 03:56.010
it must be held back

03:56.010 --> 03:57.090
from my wife,

03:57.090 --> 03:58.710
or my life will be...

03:58.730 --> 03:59.920
Fine!

04:00.850 --> 04:02.320
Since the incense smell is confirmed,

04:02.340 --> 04:04.000
it should be Si Lili.

04:04.700 --> 04:07.280
Let's hunt her down tonight.

04:07.370 --> 04:09.350
Maybe, we'll get something.

04:09.370 --> 04:10.370
Clean your face immediately.

04:10.370 --> 04:11.640
We're doing it now.

04:15.370 --> 04:16.860
That lady rode her own horse

04:16.860 --> 04:18.570
towards the Pijia Hill.

04:18.890 --> 04:19.840
There are two ways

04:19.860 --> 04:21.020
to the Danzhou Harbor.

04:21.020 --> 04:22.260
One is the Pijia Hill.

04:22.260 --> 04:24.010
Second is the Chaomeng River.

04:25.170 --> 04:26.590
How do you know where she went?

04:26.610 --> 04:27.820
She inquired about the way.

04:27.820 --> 04:29.610
I persuaded her not to travel in the evening

04:29.610 --> 04:30.860
as the Pijia Hill

04:30.860 --> 04:32.000
is swarmed with robbers,

04:32.020 --> 04:34.010
but she just didn't listen.

04:34.650 --> 04:35.810
Thank you!

04:36.770 --> 04:37.210
Let's go!

04:37.210 --> 04:38.440
Sure!

04:39.460 --> 04:40.690
Hold on please!

04:46.210 --> 04:49.160
Soybean, alfalfa, and eggs.

04:49.580 --> 04:50.590
Your Excellency,

04:50.610 --> 04:51.770
what her horse took

04:51.770 --> 04:53.760
was premium forage.

04:53.860 --> 04:54.960
It is all plains and hills

04:54.980 --> 04:56.750
in the Pijia Hill region.

04:56.770 --> 04:58.120
That's very convenient for horses to travel.

04:58.140 --> 05:00.240
If we are to catch up with her,

05:00.260 --> 05:02.290
we'd better take horses as well.

05:36.170 --> 05:37.410
What's up?

05:39.140 --> 05:40.970
There is fresh horse waste there.

06:08.610 --> 06:10.590
Well, Your Excellency,

06:10.610 --> 06:13.440
this is the premium forage from the inn.

06:13.580 --> 06:14.630
We're on the right track.

06:14.650 --> 06:16.850
Si Lili should be ahead of us.

06:21.650 --> 06:23.160
Wait a minute!

06:24.140 --> 06:25.220
What's up, Your Excellency?

06:25.460 --> 06:26.170
It makes me feel so awkward

06:26.170 --> 06:27.580
when I saw you

06:27.580 --> 06:29.240
eating it just now.

06:29.260 --> 06:30.410
Your Excellency,

06:31.210 --> 06:32.420
I didn't eat it.

06:32.420 --> 06:33.630
Don't you think it's too smooth?

06:33.650 --> 06:35.250
What is too smooth?

06:35.300 --> 06:37.240
The finding of poison, the finding of Si Lili,

06:37.260 --> 06:38.840
and the tracing of her marks.

06:38.860 --> 06:40.280
Everything happens one after another so smoothly.

06:40.300 --> 06:41.870
Isn't that good?

06:41.890 --> 06:43.280
She detected us first,

06:43.300 --> 06:44.030
right?

06:44.050 --> 06:44.750
Yeah!

06:44.770 --> 06:46.150
So she poisoned us.

06:46.170 --> 06:46.740
Why did she

06:46.740 --> 06:48.250
poison us?

06:50.140 --> 06:51.020
She...

06:51.020 --> 06:52.740
Because we're chasing her!

06:52.740 --> 06:54.560
Then why would she leave in advance

06:54.580 --> 06:56.200
before we got poisoned?

06:56.770 --> 07:00.370
It must be her cautiousness in action.

07:02.770 --> 07:04.420
I poisoned Si Lili

07:04.420 --> 07:06.160
the first time I saw her.

07:06.980 --> 07:09.300
Is that your foible?

07:09.300 --> 07:10.720
My point is

07:10.740 --> 07:13.010
she knew I'm proficient at pharmacology.

07:13.050 --> 07:14.190
But the poison that she applied

07:14.210 --> 07:15.810
is too mediocre.

07:16.770 --> 07:18.010
Perhaps

07:18.370 --> 07:20.530
she doesn't have any better poison.

07:21.980 --> 07:23.240
If I were she,

07:23.260 --> 07:25.520
I might as well sneak off than using poison.

07:25.540 --> 07:26.560
And

07:26.580 --> 07:27.930
she told her way of escaping

07:27.930 --> 07:28.800
to the waiter.

07:28.820 --> 07:29.490
Isn't that

07:29.490 --> 07:30.920
a bit intentional?

07:32.610 --> 07:33.970
Your Excellency mean

07:34.170 --> 07:36.440
she did it deliberately to create confusion?

07:37.580 --> 07:38.370
Is it possible that

07:38.370 --> 07:39.770
she went to the Pijia Hill

07:39.770 --> 07:41.190
while diverting us to the Chaomeng River?

07:41.210 --> 07:42.470
No, Your Excellency!

07:42.490 --> 07:44.050
I've checked all the forks

07:44.050 --> 07:44.930
on the road.

07:44.930 --> 07:46.090
There is no human trace

07:46.090 --> 07:47.440
to the direction of the Chaomeng River.

07:47.460 --> 07:49.000
And on our way here,

07:49.020 --> 07:49.580
the horse footprints

07:49.580 --> 07:52.680
have been evading from the low-lying muddy grounds.

07:52.700 --> 07:54.020
Evidently,

07:54.020 --> 07:56.530
the horse is manipulated by someone.

07:56.820 --> 07:57.980
I always have the feeling that

07:57.980 --> 07:59.720
she is waiting for our catch-up.

08:00.330 --> 08:02.960
Your Excellency, you are thinking too much.

08:02.980 --> 08:04.890
She is simply too panicked to select her way

08:04.890 --> 08:06.810
which gives her away.

08:09.020 --> 08:10.880
How long will it take before we catch up with her?

08:11.770 --> 08:13.970
Her horse is very tired now.

08:15.740 --> 08:16.520
Tomorrow morning!

08:16.540 --> 08:17.260
We can catch up with her

08:17.260 --> 08:19.440
by tomorrow morning for sure.

08:22.700 --> 08:23.720
Let's continue!

08:23.740 --> 08:25.070
We'll see when we catch her.

08:25.090 --> 08:26.410
Yes, Your Excellency!

09:11.370 --> 09:12.840
Si Lili!

09:16.820 --> 09:18.800
There you are finally.

09:18.820 --> 09:20.960
I've been looking forward to this moment for a long time.

09:21.020 --> 09:22.720
You are a Beiqi agent?

09:23.340 --> 09:24.570
Yes!

09:26.530 --> 09:29.160
Did you try to assassin me at Niulan Street?

09:29.660 --> 09:31.950
I like you so much.

09:31.970 --> 09:33.650
Why would I kill you?

09:38.100 --> 09:40.040
Let's take our time to discuss it
after we get back to the capital city.

09:40.290 --> 09:41.570
Mr. Fan,

09:41.780 --> 09:43.470
could you let me go?

09:43.490 --> 09:44.720
No!

09:47.530 --> 09:50.210
I was quite scared

09:50.340 --> 09:51.510
to see you in the inn in town.

09:51.530 --> 09:53.510
I was quite careful with my escape,

09:53.530 --> 09:55.920
but you caught up with me any way.

09:55.970 --> 09:57.640
Your technique of hunting

09:57.660 --> 09:59.140
is really spectacular.

09:59.140 --> 10:00.520
Thanks to Wang!

10:01.020 --> 10:02.510
You're welcome, Your Excellency!

10:02.530 --> 10:04.240
I've long heard that

10:04.260 --> 10:05.510
Miss Lili is elegant and refined.

10:05.530 --> 10:06.590
You're indeed stunning

10:06.610 --> 10:08.570
when seeing in person.

10:12.820 --> 10:15.370
Do you know why I led you here

10:15.370 --> 10:16.920
with the poison?

10:17.610 --> 10:19.450
So it is really intentional.

10:21.050 --> 10:22.440
Because I was worried

10:22.460 --> 10:24.210
no matter how much I ran,

10:24.530 --> 10:25.830
I wouldn't escape.

10:25.850 --> 10:27.590
So you allow yourself

10:27.610 --> 10:29.250
to be seized without any resistance?

10:30.660 --> 10:32.160
If that's the case,

10:32.370 --> 10:35.120
I should give up in the inn.

10:35.140 --> 10:37.330
Why would I run for one extra night?

10:37.820 --> 10:39.210
Robbers?

10:41.820 --> 10:43.250
What robbers?

10:43.580 --> 10:45.840
You're indeed smart!

11:04.050 --> 11:06.000
The robbers that hold this place

11:06.020 --> 11:07.810
are also Beiqi agents.

11:08.220 --> 11:10.590
We had the appointment to meet here from the start.

11:10.610 --> 11:11.900
We found only you and Wang Qinian

11:11.900 --> 11:13.920
in the inn.

11:13.970 --> 11:16.350
So, we'd just make full use of the chance

11:16.370 --> 11:18.040
to set up an ambush.

11:24.610 --> 11:25.610
Take care!

11:25.610 --> 11:27.370
Allow me to leave.

11:48.340 --> 11:49.650
Your Excellency!

11:49.730 --> 11:51.250
This is it!

11:51.530 --> 11:52.910
It is a bit longer!

11:52.930 --> 11:54.370
Make do with it.

12:01.020 --> 12:03.810
They are all above Sixth Dan.

12:04.370 --> 12:06.370
It's better for us to find a chance

12:06.460 --> 12:07.720
and submerge into the ground.

12:16.050 --> 12:17.240
Your Excellency,

12:17.260 --> 12:18.390
it's too early

12:18.410 --> 12:20.170
to kneel down for mercy now!

12:20.170 --> 12:21.450
It's shaking!

12:21.900 --> 12:23.080
What is shaking?

12:23.100 --> 12:24.570
The stones.

12:24.900 --> 12:26.930
Your Excellency, this is not the right time

12:26.930 --> 12:28.370
to bend down and watch the stones.

12:28.370 --> 12:29.690
Your Excellency!

13:24.610 --> 13:26.210
Black knights!

13:36.700 --> 13:39.370
The black knights showed up in the east?

13:39.460 --> 13:40.510
We just got the message.

13:40.530 --> 13:42.120
Isn't the Head back to his hometown?

13:42.140 --> 13:44.160
How come he deployed the black knights?

13:45.820 --> 13:46.910
Get it investigated.

13:46.930 --> 13:48.160
Yes!

13:49.780 --> 13:50.910
The First Division's role

13:50.930 --> 13:53.000
is to manage the affairs in the capital city.

13:53.020 --> 13:54.570
You don't need to

13:54.730 --> 13:57.280
care so much about the affairs out of it.

13:58.850 --> 14:00.220
Don't you want to know

14:00.220 --> 14:01.490
why the black knights

14:01.490 --> 14:02.370
were deployed suddenly?

14:02.370 --> 14:03.820
The black knights are a very strong force

14:03.820 --> 14:05.280
governed by the Head directly.

14:05.340 --> 14:06.710
We have no right

14:06.730 --> 14:08.080
to investigate their whereabouts.

14:08.100 --> 14:09.910
But the Head has gone back to his hometown.

14:09.930 --> 14:10.660
Why were the black knights

14:10.660 --> 14:12.210
deployed all of a sudden?

14:13.020 --> 14:14.760
It has nothing to do

14:14.780 --> 14:16.710
with you or me.

14:16.730 --> 14:18.080
Yan Ruohai,

14:18.370 --> 14:20.600
do you know anything secret?

14:38.410 --> 14:39.580
The strongest force

14:39.580 --> 14:41.080
in the Investigator's Office

14:41.100 --> 14:43.140
are the black knights

14:43.140 --> 14:44.370
governed by the Head directly.

14:44.610 --> 14:46.720
It's the strongest cavalry

14:47.220 --> 14:49.020
approved by His Majesty

14:49.020 --> 14:50.680
to protect the Head.

14:50.700 --> 14:52.440
Isn't the Head back to his hometown?

14:52.460 --> 14:53.850
How come the black knights are here?

14:53.850 --> 14:55.400
The black knights' showing up

14:55.490 --> 14:58.160
means the Head is not far either.

14:58.490 --> 15:00.370
I can't wait to see

15:00.460 --> 15:01.460
what kind of a person he is

15:01.460 --> 15:03.030
who controls the terrible giant

15:03.050 --> 15:04.800
and beast-like Investigator's Office

15:04.820 --> 15:06.210
The Head hasn't come.

15:08.850 --> 15:10.590
Master Shadow!

15:10.610 --> 15:10.960
The Head knows all about what happened in the capital city.

15:10.960 --> 15:12.290
=Shadow, Director of the Sixth Division=
The Head knows all about what happened in the capital city.

15:12.290 --> 15:12.410
=Shadow, Director of the Sixth Division
of the Nanqing Investigator's Office=

15:12.410 --> 15:12.560
=Shadow, Director of the Sixth Division=
He has a message for you.

15:12.560 --> 15:13.800
He has a message for you.

15:13.820 --> 15:14.760
Me?

15:14.780 --> 15:16.690
He wants you to act with a free hand.

15:16.730 --> 15:18.080
Even if the sky falls down,

15:18.100 --> 15:20.210
he will push it back.

15:20.410 --> 15:21.710
The Head knows me?

15:21.730 --> 15:22.710
That's all the words he wants to deliver.

15:22.730 --> 15:24.150
When will the Head come back to the capital city?

15:24.170 --> 15:26.000
He will be back

15:26.020 --> 15:27.600
when you need him the most.

15:30.100 --> 15:33.200
In spite that the Sixth Division of
the Investigator's Office takes charge of assassination,

15:33.220 --> 15:34.440
the most terrible assassin

15:34.460 --> 15:36.590
publicly known to everyone

15:36.610 --> 15:38.770
is Master Shadow.

15:39.220 --> 15:41.000
He follows the Head all the year round.

15:41.020 --> 15:42.140
But no one ever knows

15:42.140 --> 15:42.930
what he looks like,

15:42.930 --> 15:44.450
neither does anyone

15:44.610 --> 15:46.080
know his name.

15:46.260 --> 15:47.170
That is to say,

15:47.170 --> 15:48.410
he could be anyone

15:48.410 --> 15:49.390
around us.

15:49.410 --> 15:50.600
Yes!

15:51.460 --> 15:52.830
A sweeping force of cavalries

15:52.850 --> 15:54.290
turns all the tricks

15:54.290 --> 15:55.800
into a joke.

15:55.820 --> 15:57.920
That's the strong in real sense.

15:59.900 --> 16:01.520
Who are you?

16:01.820 --> 16:03.100
Why does Chen Pingping

16:03.100 --> 16:04.470
send the black knights for you?

16:04.490 --> 16:06.000
You may not believe it that

16:06.020 --> 16:07.890
it's the first time for me to hear this name.

16:08.170 --> 16:10.280
Chen Pingping is the name of the Head!

16:10.660 --> 16:12.100
It's a taboo to address him by his name directly.

16:12.100 --> 16:13.840
Which Ping is it?

16:14.850 --> 16:16.590
The one in Fuping (duckweeds).

16:16.610 --> 16:18.200
Sounds a bit delicate.

16:18.220 --> 16:19.440
Didn't you say we shouldn't address him by his name?

16:19.460 --> 16:21.510
No, don't do that!

16:21.530 --> 16:24.390
This name used to sweep cross the world

16:24.410 --> 16:26.370
and it is a nightmare to all Kingdoms.

16:26.580 --> 16:28.030
Chen Pingping from the Investigator's Office

16:28.050 --> 16:30.200
is publicly known as King of Nights

16:30.220 --> 16:31.290
and the source of all sins.

16:31.290 --> 16:34.480
Let's discuss it on our way back.

16:35.220 --> 16:36.480
Your Excellency,

16:39.170 --> 16:40.760
we must be careful

16:40.780 --> 16:42.720
on the way back.

16:43.170 --> 16:44.450
What do you mean?

16:45.820 --> 16:47.510
The Niulan Street assassination

16:47.530 --> 16:48.580
involves masters

16:48.580 --> 16:50.450
from both Beiqi and Dongyi Town

16:50.580 --> 16:53.210
and also the archer of the Capital Garrison.

16:53.850 --> 16:55.040
These cannot be manipulated

16:55.260 --> 16:57.640
by an agent.

16:57.660 --> 16:58.960
I'm afraid

16:59.020 --> 17:02.010
there is a big figure behind it.

17:02.490 --> 17:03.720
So?

17:04.700 --> 17:06.530
It's quite complicated

17:06.860 --> 17:07.860
and we'd better stay covert

17:07.860 --> 17:09.480
on the way.

17:09.500 --> 17:10.410
Don't let anyone know

17:10.410 --> 17:12.960
we have captured her.

17:12.980 --> 17:15.290
Are you worried that she'll be killed
half way to keep her mouth shut?

17:16.980 --> 17:18.750
Anything can happen

17:18.770 --> 17:21.370
before we get back.

17:22.820 --> 17:24.320
Black knights sweeping through

17:24.770 --> 17:25.800
is a scene

17:25.820 --> 17:27.680
which can't be hidden.

17:28.890 --> 17:29.500
I'm afraid we'll have to

17:29.500 --> 17:31.410
act the other way around.

17:31.580 --> 17:33.080
The other way around?

17:33.860 --> 17:35.050
What do you mean?

17:52.890 --> 17:57.630
Fan Xian from Danzhou travelled a long way

17:57.650 --> 18:00.740
to capture Si Lili, the Beiqi agent,

18:00.740 --> 18:03.290
and escort her back to the capital city.

18:07.170 --> 18:08.580
It seems Si Lili

18:08.580 --> 18:10.500
has committed something serious.

18:10.500 --> 18:13.080
It's surprising that she is an agent.

18:33.250 --> 18:35.480
Fan Xian's got a great formation.

18:35.500 --> 18:36.840
Seizure of the Beiqi agent

18:36.860 --> 18:38.440
is something that can be done but cannot be disclosed.

18:38.460 --> 18:39.960
Straightforward as he is,

18:39.980 --> 18:41.080
he is also clever.

18:41.100 --> 18:42.930
The more people know about it,

18:42.930 --> 18:44.740
the safer their way of return will be.

18:44.740 --> 18:46.580
Whoever tries to do something bad to them

18:46.580 --> 18:48.870
reveals the guilt from the heart.

18:48.890 --> 18:50.840
It is so according to logical thinking.

18:51.410 --> 18:53.960
Is there any other possibility?

18:54.250 --> 18:56.370
This is no longer a concern

18:56.530 --> 18:58.560
if one is crazy.

19:09.890 --> 19:11.480
Auntie, what are you laughing at?

19:13.220 --> 19:15.200
My future son-in-law

19:15.620 --> 19:16.870
is indeed funny.

19:16.890 --> 19:18.100
Si Lili is a potato

19:18.100 --> 19:19.560
too hot to hold now.

19:19.580 --> 19:21.910
It's plausibly wise

19:21.930 --> 19:23.770
to return on a large scale.

19:23.860 --> 19:27.290
Shall we just kill him?

19:28.170 --> 19:28.890
Kill him?

19:28.890 --> 19:30.480
He will reach the capital city tomorrow

19:30.770 --> 19:32.680
with his current speed.

19:33.530 --> 19:34.700
If we send killers

19:34.700 --> 19:36.720
to kill him outside of the capital city,

19:36.980 --> 19:39.050
Wan'er doesn't need to marry him.

19:39.130 --> 19:42.130
The power of Neiku doesn't need to be handed over either.

19:42.380 --> 19:43.750
What a perfect chance!

19:43.770 --> 19:44.530
Si Lili is very suspicious

19:44.530 --> 19:46.630
to be Beiqi agent.

19:46.650 --> 19:48.360
If we take action now,

19:48.380 --> 19:50.510
it's very likely that we'll be convicted
of killing to keep her mouth shut.

19:50.530 --> 19:52.410
Isn't that more interesting?

19:53.770 --> 19:54.990
Auntie,

19:55.010 --> 19:57.080
this is really not the right time to kill him.

19:57.100 --> 19:58.560
Seriously?

19:58.580 --> 20:00.600
If you do that,

20:00.890 --> 20:03.370
I'll be in grave danger.

20:07.820 --> 20:08.990
You see?

20:09.010 --> 20:10.720
I'm just having a joke with him.

20:10.740 --> 20:12.680
He takes it too seriously.

20:24.340 --> 20:25.720
Wait!

20:25.980 --> 20:27.250
Your Excellency!

20:30.700 --> 20:31.290
This is the third bunch of people

20:31.290 --> 20:32.800
in such a short while.

20:32.820 --> 20:34.480
Let's take a guess

20:34.500 --> 20:36.250
whose side they are from.

20:39.740 --> 20:41.200
From the Capital Garrison.

20:42.860 --> 20:44.440
They want to take her away as well?

20:44.460 --> 20:45.230
Yeah!

20:45.250 --> 20:47.150
I have turned them down

20:47.170 --> 20:48.960
in the name of the Investigator's Office.

20:51.410 --> 20:52.870
The Capital Garrison,

20:52.890 --> 20:54.480
the Prefecture of Capital City,

20:54.530 --> 20:55.870
and the Ministry of Penalty

20:55.890 --> 20:57.840
all want you.

21:00.740 --> 21:02.250
You are after all

21:02.250 --> 21:03.800
a live Beiqi agent.

21:07.100 --> 21:09.130
Once they get

21:09.580 --> 21:11.560
any new intelligence from you,

21:11.580 --> 21:13.770
it will be a great achievement.

21:21.410 --> 21:23.230
You know it very well that

21:23.250 --> 21:25.600
no matter to which side I hand you over,

21:25.650 --> 21:26.530
what awaits you ahead

21:26.530 --> 21:28.360
is endless excruciation.

21:28.380 --> 21:29.340
Dying will be luxurious

21:29.340 --> 21:31.600
by then.

21:37.170 --> 21:39.960
Your heartbeat is faster. Are you nervous?

21:42.860 --> 21:45.250
Who is the head of conspiracy
for the Niulan Street assassination?

21:49.340 --> 21:52.480
Why does it have to have a head?

21:53.290 --> 21:54.620
Why can't I be the person

21:54.620 --> 21:56.110
to have planned it all?

21:56.130 --> 21:58.130
You don't have the motive to kill me.

21:59.980 --> 22:01.560
Do you really think

22:01.580 --> 22:03.100
I'm so deeply into you,

22:03.100 --> 22:05.130
Mr. Fan?

22:09.530 --> 22:12.010
You're a Beiqi agent

22:12.500 --> 22:15.170
who has been lurking in the capital city for so many years.

22:16.050 --> 22:17.130
No one knows

22:17.130 --> 22:18.770
how much efforts you've made

22:19.410 --> 22:21.770
to become the courtesan in the Joy Tsin House.

22:21.890 --> 22:24.170
The people you're in touch with
are all high officials and celebrities.

22:24.170 --> 22:25.650
It's the prime time

22:25.650 --> 22:27.290
to collect intelligence.

22:28.930 --> 22:31.130
Your exposure of identity now

22:31.220 --> 22:33.440
will ruin all your previous efforts.

22:35.340 --> 22:37.320
It'll make sense

22:37.530 --> 22:39.460
if it's the Crown Prince, His Majesty,

22:39.460 --> 22:40.910
or the Prime Minister that you're trying to kill

22:40.930 --> 22:42.530
after all these efforts.

22:44.460 --> 22:46.130
It is otherwise

22:46.340 --> 22:47.720
if your target is me.

22:49.890 --> 22:52.410
What fantastic reasoning!

22:53.290 --> 22:55.150
Is that a confirmation

22:55.170 --> 22:57.480
that someone else is behind it?

22:58.100 --> 23:00.010
Why don't you figure it out yourself

23:00.460 --> 23:01.340
since you're so smart?

23:01.340 --> 23:02.750
Who is it?

23:02.770 --> 23:05.030
Why don't you just tell me

23:05.050 --> 23:06.930
and I'll save your life?

23:18.500 --> 23:20.150
As you said

23:20.170 --> 23:22.050
just now,

23:22.100 --> 23:24.320
every ministry wants to interrogate me.

23:24.340 --> 23:26.650
How do you save me from that?

23:27.890 --> 23:29.530
You'll hand me over anyway

23:29.770 --> 23:32.410
after we arrive at the capital city tomorrow.

23:32.530 --> 23:34.600
It makes no difference

23:34.620 --> 23:36.480
to say it or not to say it.

23:38.580 --> 23:40.560
You're the prisoner of the Investigator's Office.

23:40.580 --> 23:42.370
I don't need to hand you over.

23:44.500 --> 23:46.130
Should you be really important

23:46.130 --> 23:47.510
in the Investigator's Office,

23:47.530 --> 23:48.890
how come you chase me

23:48.890 --> 23:50.410
without any retinues?

23:51.050 --> 23:53.170
That's non-sense. I am his retinue.

23:56.100 --> 23:57.890
Have some water please, Your Excellency!

24:02.740 --> 24:05.320
Keeping it a secret,

24:05.820 --> 24:08.770
I may still get rescued by that person.

24:08.980 --> 24:10.840
If I really speak it out,

24:11.410 --> 24:13.840
I'll end up on the chopping block.

24:14.220 --> 24:15.720
Saving you now is too difficult.

24:15.740 --> 24:17.890
I would kill you to keep
your mouth shut if I were that big figure.

24:18.380 --> 24:20.010
As you said yourself,

24:20.220 --> 24:21.010
what awaits me ahead

24:21.010 --> 24:22.960
is endless excruciation.

24:23.500 --> 24:25.480
Getting killed

24:26.620 --> 24:29.050
is no less of an extrication.

24:37.980 --> 24:39.080
How about

24:39.100 --> 24:40.720
you telling me the name secretly

24:40.740 --> 24:42.410
and then I set you free secretly?

24:47.530 --> 24:49.650
Are you serious?

24:50.980 --> 24:52.100
Right now,

24:52.100 --> 24:54.800
the eyes of every ministry are cast on me.

24:55.220 --> 24:56.800
You dare to set me free now?

25:32.820 --> 25:34.440
Your Excellency,

25:34.500 --> 25:36.530
we'd better go back to watch over her.

25:36.530 --> 25:37.510
No need.

25:37.530 --> 25:38.130
I'm afraid this yard

25:38.130 --> 25:39.340
should have been encircled

25:39.340 --> 25:40.650
by all the scouts from different ministries.

25:40.740 --> 25:42.440
She can't escape.

25:53.770 --> 25:55.800
If we had known that earlier,

25:56.500 --> 25:58.340
we could have taken our time

25:58.340 --> 26:00.320
for the return trip.

26:02.050 --> 26:03.320
Black knights' showing up

26:03.340 --> 26:04.170
means the Head

26:04.170 --> 26:05.840
already knows about it.

26:06.050 --> 26:07.250
If we don't return immediately,

26:07.250 --> 26:08.930
it's very suspicious that we're colluding with the enemies.

26:09.130 --> 26:10.840
That's dangerous to the family.

26:11.860 --> 26:13.370
You're right!

26:14.650 --> 26:16.800
But Master Shadow said

26:17.010 --> 26:18.840
you can do whatever you think necessary

26:18.860 --> 26:20.030
and the Head will help you

26:20.050 --> 26:22.200
if anything goes wrong.

26:22.290 --> 26:24.630
Chen Pingping and I are neither families nor friends.

26:24.650 --> 26:26.440
Why would he help me?

26:27.700 --> 26:30.130
Your Excellency still don't trust him.

26:33.340 --> 26:34.750
Human mind is changeable.

26:34.770 --> 26:36.600
I can't trust him

26:36.620 --> 26:38.320
before I meet him in person.

26:41.340 --> 26:42.480
Your Excellency,

26:42.500 --> 26:44.480
before handing over Si Lili,

26:44.500 --> 26:46.410
you still have another option.

26:53.170 --> 26:55.110
Do you mean to lynch?

26:55.130 --> 26:56.860
Yeah!

26:56.860 --> 26:59.440
Now Si Lili is under your control.

26:59.460 --> 27:02.110
If you lynch her,

27:02.130 --> 27:03.720
she probably will tell the truth

27:03.740 --> 27:06.890
after one night's of torture.

27:09.580 --> 27:10.770
It's very easy

27:10.770 --> 27:12.010
to torture a weak lady.

27:12.340 --> 27:13.990
But if we have no bottom-line,

27:14.010 --> 27:15.960
are we any different from animals?

27:18.620 --> 27:20.290
You're right, Your Excellency!

27:20.620 --> 27:21.600
So,

27:21.620 --> 27:23.480
we'll have to wait

27:23.500 --> 27:24.200
for other chances

27:24.220 --> 27:26.600
after we get back to the capital city.

27:28.410 --> 27:29.770
Wang Qinian!

27:30.170 --> 27:31.290
If I chose to lynch

27:31.290 --> 27:32.840
just now,

27:32.890 --> 27:35.130
will you leave me?

27:36.530 --> 27:38.930
If Your Excellency has no bottom-line,

27:39.130 --> 27:40.170
then my monthly payment

27:40.170 --> 27:41.500
of 150 taels of silvers

27:41.500 --> 27:43.080
will not be guaranteed.

27:43.100 --> 27:45.130
50 taels! 50 taels!

27:45.930 --> 27:47.320
Don't worry, Your Excellency!

27:47.620 --> 27:50.080
As long as you keep paying me 50 taels of silver,

27:50.530 --> 27:51.360
I will always follow you

27:51.380 --> 27:54.650
and serve you.

28:07.860 --> 28:08.930
They are all

28:08.930 --> 28:10.680
so eager!

28:11.250 --> 28:12.750
It is a big case after all.

28:12.770 --> 28:14.010
If you don't have the support

28:14.010 --> 28:15.390
from the Investigator's Office,

28:15.410 --> 28:17.840
we may not be able to hold her.

28:42.050 --> 28:45.320
Si Lili is the prisoner of the Investigator's Office.

28:45.530 --> 28:47.200
Your Excellencies,

28:48.130 --> 28:49.720
please make way for us!

28:49.740 --> 28:51.130
Mr. Fan,

28:51.460 --> 28:52.770
we have no objection

28:52.770 --> 28:53.840
if the Investigator's Office

28:53.860 --> 28:55.510
really wants the prisoner.

28:55.530 --> 28:56.890
Please show us the arrest warrant

28:56.890 --> 28:59.770
of the Investigator's Office.

29:03.050 --> 29:05.030
We'll make it up later on.

29:05.050 --> 29:07.010
I'm afraid that's a breach of the rule.

29:07.770 --> 29:09.650
Here comes the arrest warrant!

29:37.130 --> 29:39.360
The Investigator's Office
is directly affiliated with His Majesty.

29:39.380 --> 29:41.990
It has the right to fetch anyone for interrogation

29:42.010 --> 29:43.930
for all matters in and out of the capital city.

29:43.980 --> 29:45.440
Here is the arrest warrant!

29:45.460 --> 29:45.920
If you don't have His Majesty's sacred edict,

29:45.920 --> 29:47.010
=Yan Ruohai, Director of the Fourth Division=
If you don't have His Majesty's sacred edict,

29:47.010 --> 29:48.030
=Yan Ruohai, Director of the Fourth Division
of Nanqing Investigator's Office=

29:48.050 --> 29:50.770
I'll take her away.

29:51.530 --> 29:54.320
Whoever disagrees can come and have a try.

29:56.580 --> 29:57.960
Follow me!

30:27.100 --> 30:28.440
Sister!

30:28.770 --> 30:30.050
Sister!

30:30.250 --> 30:31.600
Fan Xian is back!

30:31.620 --> 30:32.750
How do you know?

30:32.770 --> 30:33.990
The whole city has seen him.

30:34.010 --> 30:35.110
Did he make it?

30:35.130 --> 30:36.170
Fan Xian escort Si Lili

30:36.170 --> 30:37.050
back to the capital city.

30:37.050 --> 30:38.560
There are a lot of people at the city gate,

30:38.580 --> 30:40.030
seemingly to take Si Lili away.

30:40.050 --> 30:40.720
Thanks to the showing up

30:40.740 --> 30:41.890
of Yan Ruohai,

30:41.890 --> 30:42.840
Director of the Fourth Division of the Investigator's Office.

30:42.860 --> 30:43.820
He held a paper

30:43.820 --> 30:44.560
and helped them inside.

30:44.580 --> 30:46.130
He really seized her?

30:48.460 --> 30:48.990
Sister,

30:49.010 --> 30:51.150
you don't look happy about it.

30:51.170 --> 30:55.290
It is not necessarily a good thing.

30:55.530 --> 30:57.410
Why do you think so?

30:59.100 --> 31:00.560
Where are you going, sister?

31:08.890 --> 31:10.930
Why are you still following me?

31:11.820 --> 31:12.840
Your Excellency,

31:12.860 --> 31:14.270
Si Lili's case

31:14.290 --> 31:15.680
is connected with the Niulan Street assassination.

31:15.700 --> 31:17.320
Can I take charge of the trial?

31:17.460 --> 31:18.960
Do you think I'll hand her over to you

31:18.980 --> 31:20.930
now that I've come in person?

31:22.930 --> 31:23.800
Your Excellency!

31:23.820 --> 31:26.510
Agents and military organizations
are in the domain of the Fourth Division.

31:26.530 --> 31:27.480
You're off the case.

31:27.500 --> 31:28.440
She was captured by me.

31:28.460 --> 31:30.010
You have all the credit to the capture.

31:30.130 --> 31:32.170
Let that write off

31:32.170 --> 31:34.080
Wang Qinian's stealing of the file.

31:34.220 --> 31:35.980
The assassination is after all related to me.

31:35.980 --> 31:37.650
Then you surely need to stay out to avoid suspicion.

31:38.290 --> 31:39.720
Go back!

31:43.010 --> 31:46.050
Or you want a fight with me?

31:54.820 --> 31:56.800
Mr. Fan, aren't you gonna save me?

31:56.820 --> 31:58.320
Where are your actions?

32:09.620 --> 32:10.960
Your Excellency!

32:34.930 --> 32:36.410
Your Highness!

32:36.650 --> 32:38.200
Fan Ruoruo, the daughter of Assistant
Minister of Ministry of Revenue Fan Jian,

32:38.220 --> 32:40.130
wants to see you.

32:41.220 --> 32:42.750
How come she comes to me?

32:42.770 --> 32:43.990
I asked her the reason.

32:44.010 --> 32:46.560
She doesn't want to tell me.

32:47.770 --> 32:49.480
What the procedures they are!

32:50.980 --> 32:52.370
Let her in.

32:52.650 --> 32:53.800
Yes!

32:57.410 --> 32:58.770
Your Excellency!

32:59.770 --> 33:01.200
Your Excellency!

33:02.980 --> 33:04.480
Your Excellency!

33:11.220 --> 33:11.980
She is gone!

33:11.980 --> 33:13.890
What's the point of keeping that?

33:14.050 --> 33:15.560
Dismantle it and get it disposed!

33:32.580 --> 33:34.250
Don't be mad, Your Excellency!

33:34.700 --> 33:36.290
After all, Yan Bingyun, his son,

33:36.290 --> 33:37.510
went to Beiqi

33:37.530 --> 33:39.230
because of you.

33:39.250 --> 33:41.230
Naturally, he's a bit apathetic to you

33:41.250 --> 33:42.840
which makes sense.

33:42.860 --> 33:43.870
You're hungry, aren't you?

33:43.890 --> 33:45.110
What did you say?

33:45.130 --> 33:47.170
We've been rushing for so many days.

33:47.220 --> 33:48.930
Shall I treat you with a good meal?

33:49.340 --> 33:51.130
No, that's not needed.

33:51.250 --> 33:52.360
I have to

33:52.380 --> 33:53.410
go home

33:53.410 --> 33:55.220
and let my wife know I'm back safe and sound.

33:55.220 --> 33:57.510
And, I miss my daughter now.

33:57.530 --> 33:58.560
Right!

33:58.580 --> 34:00.320
Come to me after you're done!

34:00.340 --> 34:01.560
As you're in my team,

34:01.580 --> 34:03.600
we need to report to the mansion together.

34:04.380 --> 34:05.560
Yes, Your Excellency!

34:05.860 --> 34:08.920
So, you're alright?

34:08.940 --> 34:10.730
Of course!

34:10.900 --> 34:12.450
Remember to come to my mansion.

34:30.690 --> 34:32.560
It's wide spread that

34:33.100 --> 34:36.210
Fan Ruoruo is the first talented girl in the capital city.

34:40.140 --> 34:41.970
Lady Ruoruo, have you heard it?

34:43.290 --> 34:44.920
I'm too humble to deserve praises like this.

34:44.940 --> 34:46.730
Why do you come here?

34:47.450 --> 34:50.130
Your Highness, please ask the guards to leave us alone.

34:56.180 --> 34:57.470
You can talk now.

34:57.490 --> 34:59.270
I believe Your Highness already know

34:59.290 --> 35:01.410
Si Lili is escorted back to the capital city.

35:03.450 --> 35:05.750
Fan Xian is really knowledgeable.

35:05.770 --> 35:08.270
Firstly, he shocked the crowd with a poem.

35:08.290 --> 35:10.880
Then he killed an Eighth Dan
Martial Arts Master on the street.

35:10.900 --> 35:12.450
Now he captured the Beiqi agent

35:12.450 --> 35:14.000
with his own hands.

35:14.250 --> 35:16.360
He's impressive.

35:16.380 --> 35:19.240
Acting too wild is easy to cause trouble.

35:19.340 --> 35:20.820
I'm willing to monitor my brother's behaviors

35:20.820 --> 35:22.950
for Your Highness.

35:22.970 --> 35:25.170
If he acts too exceptionally,

35:25.340 --> 35:27.490
I'd report to you in private.

35:29.580 --> 35:31.690
I heard that

35:31.770 --> 35:32.770
you have a really deep tie with Fan Xian

35:32.770 --> 35:34.840
as brother and sister.

35:34.860 --> 35:37.360
That's why I need to protect his life.

35:37.380 --> 35:39.760
You think I'm going to kill him?

35:40.290 --> 35:41.880
That's not important.

35:41.900 --> 35:44.430
My brother is arrogant and doesn't refrain himself

35:44.450 --> 35:46.800
from all the disrespect to you.

35:46.820 --> 35:48.190
Sooner or later,

35:48.210 --> 35:50.470
the whole family will get involved in his convictions.

35:50.490 --> 35:52.080
I do so

35:52.100 --> 35:54.450
for the good of the Fan mansion.

35:55.900 --> 35:58.280
Interesting!

36:00.100 --> 36:01.450
My Lady!

36:01.690 --> 36:03.490
-My Lady! -What happened?

36:06.730 --> 36:08.650
He... He... He...

36:08.940 --> 36:10.030
Calm down!

36:10.050 --> 36:12.400
Isn't he the miracle-working doctor?

36:12.420 --> 36:14.270
He is the miracle-working doctor and also Fan Xian.

36:14.290 --> 36:15.470
I need to talk to him.

36:15.490 --> 36:18.080
Leave us and close the door!

36:18.100 --> 36:19.490
Leave!

36:31.860 --> 36:33.560
Why do you come in day time?

36:33.580 --> 36:36.130
I just got back and I want to meet you.

36:37.690 --> 36:39.400
It's said you captured Si Lili.

36:39.420 --> 36:40.840
Are you hurt?

36:41.490 --> 36:42.930
Safe and sound!

36:44.210 --> 36:45.160
I can't get hurt

36:45.180 --> 36:46.510
with my proficiency at martial art.

36:46.530 --> 36:47.890
Where is she?

36:51.660 --> 36:52.710
As soon as I went through the gate,

36:52.730 --> 36:54.190
both the Ministry of Personnel
and the Ministry of Penalty came to take her over.

36:54.210 --> 36:56.000
She was eventually taken away by the Investigator's Office.

36:56.290 --> 36:58.170
Alright! Let's not talk about these.

36:58.420 --> 36:59.430
Is that edible?

36:59.450 --> 37:00.760
I feel hungry now.

37:02.580 --> 37:04.360
That's my leftover.

37:04.380 --> 37:05.800
I don't mind!

37:20.820 --> 37:23.130
You won't give up like this.

37:23.290 --> 37:26.470
You can't let go of Teng Zijing's death.

37:26.490 --> 37:27.930
Don't talk!

37:28.730 --> 37:30.320
I just want to sit beside you quietly

37:30.380 --> 37:32.600
like this for a while.

37:56.580 --> 37:58.560
I always wondered

37:58.970 --> 38:01.240
if I hadn't gone to the Qing Temple that day,

38:03.620 --> 38:04.340
I would not have met you

38:04.340 --> 38:06.280
holding a drumstick.

38:07.340 --> 38:10.690
Time flows like a river. Lives are like fishes in it.

38:10.770 --> 38:12.710
They meet in undercurrent and rapid torrent.

38:12.730 --> 38:14.520
We're destined to meet.

38:14.770 --> 38:16.520
Even if we hadn't met on that day,

38:16.730 --> 38:18.890
we'd meet elsewhere.

38:19.050 --> 38:20.520
We're destined to meet?

38:20.660 --> 38:21.970
Perhaps!

38:22.860 --> 38:24.280
I feel so much settled

38:24.970 --> 38:26.930
after hearing your words.

38:34.050 --> 38:36.130
You can turn to Ye Ling'er!

38:36.900 --> 38:39.360
Ye Ling'er? What do I turn to her for?

38:39.380 --> 38:41.240
She's been to the Joy Tsin House.

38:41.290 --> 38:42.920
Why would she go there?

38:42.940 --> 38:43.730
When she knew

38:43.730 --> 38:45.190
you are Fan Xian on that day,

38:45.210 --> 38:46.420
she insisted in visiting the Joy Tsin House

38:46.420 --> 38:47.530
to check out if there is anything

38:47.530 --> 38:49.000
between you and Si Lili.

38:49.100 --> 38:49.950
After that,

38:49.970 --> 38:50.580
the news became wide spread

38:50.580 --> 38:52.270
that she fell into the water and got saved.

38:52.290 --> 38:52.940
She never came to meet me

38:52.940 --> 38:54.560
ever since then.

38:54.580 --> 38:56.080
I think

38:56.380 --> 38:58.370
she could have seen something on that day.

39:04.770 --> 39:06.120
What a coincidence, Mr. Lin.

39:06.140 --> 39:07.690
I'm diagnosing for her.

39:10.620 --> 39:11.380
Brother!

39:11.380 --> 39:12.420
Why are you mad?

39:12.420 --> 39:13.250
You, a bastard from Danzhou!

39:13.250 --> 39:14.800
How dare you step into my sister's room?

39:14.970 --> 39:16.010
How do you know I'm Fan Xian?

39:16.010 --> 39:17.970
I must kill you with my sword today.

39:20.490 --> 39:22.520
Take out your sword then.

39:34.140 --> 39:36.710
Brother, we didn't do anything shameful.

39:36.730 --> 39:38.520
If anyone knows about this,

39:38.660 --> 39:40.030
your reputation will be ruined.

39:40.050 --> 39:42.670
But we have marriage contract.

39:42.690 --> 39:44.280
You can't marry this guy.

39:46.450 --> 39:47.820
Why do you hate Fan Xian

39:47.820 --> 39:49.410
so much?

39:53.250 --> 39:54.670
It is treacherous of him

39:54.690 --> 39:57.030
to disguise himself as doctor to meet you.

39:57.050 --> 39:58.690
If he really cares about you,

39:59.140 --> 39:59.820
he should think

39:59.820 --> 40:01.470
for your reputation.

40:01.490 --> 40:03.370
How could he do something like this?

40:03.530 --> 40:05.920
He's such a villain and not good at all.

40:05.940 --> 40:07.710
He is not that type of person.

40:07.730 --> 40:08.510
It's just that

40:08.530 --> 40:09.340
his idea

40:09.340 --> 40:10.750
differs from what people usually think.

40:10.770 --> 40:12.080
You're too naive.

40:12.100 --> 40:13.800
I'm a man as well.

40:14.210 --> 40:16.080
You may be cheated by him, but I won't.

40:16.140 --> 40:17.120
From today on,

40:17.140 --> 40:19.240
I'll send the guards here.

40:21.210 --> 40:22.950
If Fan Xian dares to come again,

40:22.970 --> 40:25.120
I'll kill him without mercy.

40:25.140 --> 40:26.730
That's going too far.

40:48.180 --> 40:49.120
Aren't you gonna ask me?

40:49.140 --> 40:50.320
Ask you what?

40:50.860 --> 40:51.840
Who wanted to kill Fan Xian.

40:51.860 --> 40:53.410
I'm not the interrogator.

40:53.690 --> 40:54.970
Who is it then?

40:55.450 --> 40:56.890
Chen Pingping is not here.

40:56.970 --> 40:58.520
Is it Zhu Ge from the First Division?

40:59.140 --> 41:00.230
I'm waiting.

41:00.250 --> 41:01.120
For what?

41:01.140 --> 41:03.000
For the interrogator to come.

41:36.010 --> 41:36.990
Can I help you?

41:37.010 --> 41:37.950
I'm Fan Xian.

41:37.970 --> 41:39.800
I want to meet Your Lady, Ye Ling'er!

41:39.820 --> 41:41.280
One moment please.

41:58.420 --> 41:59.230
What can I do for you?

41:59.250 --> 42:00.010
I heard that

42:00.010 --> 42:01.560
you fell into the Liujing River the other day.

42:01.860 --> 42:03.170
Why do you ask that?

42:03.970 --> 42:05.270
Wan'er told me

42:05.290 --> 42:06.320
you visited the Joy Tsin House

42:06.340 --> 42:07.760
to investigate Si Lili.

42:30.860 --> 42:32.240
How could it be him?

42:36.250 --> 42:37.360
Why did you fell into the river?

42:37.380 --> 42:38.670
What did you witness

42:38.690 --> 42:40.170
on the boat on that day?

42:40.940 --> 42:42.400
I didn't see anything.

42:42.420 --> 42:43.560
You're lying!

42:44.940 --> 42:45.670
You know that guy!

42:45.690 --> 42:46.470
No!

42:46.490 --> 42:47.080
No?

42:47.100 --> 42:48.800
That means you did see someone.

42:52.690 --> 42:53.890
Stop asking!

42:55.940 --> 42:58.270
You're daughter of the Chief Guard of the capital city,

42:58.290 --> 42:59.340
but you still dare not

42:59.340 --> 43:00.190
to say who it is.

43:00.210 --> 43:01.670
It must be someone

43:01.690 --> 43:03.370
with enormous power.

43:26.960 --> 43:30.540
In the river of history,

43:30.560 --> 43:34.030
time goes round and round.

43:36.840 --> 43:40.180
Memories about the former and present lives

43:40.200 --> 43:44.270
join each other in an endless way.

43:46.160 --> 43:48.780
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:48.800 --> 43:51.040
one season follows another in a flash,

43:51.040 --> 43:53.540
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:53.560 --> 43:55.160
I just can't give up

43:55.160 --> 43:58.500
to be with you for my whole life.

43:58.520 --> 44:03.990
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

44:05.240 --> 44:07.790
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:08.080 --> 44:10.120
Year after year in the wandering,

44:10.120 --> 44:12.780
I count the remaining years.

44:12.800 --> 44:14.980
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:15.000 --> 44:16.990
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:17.280 --> 44:19.670
I never feel regretful.

44:19.720 --> 44:21.080
In such a chaotic world,

44:21.080 --> 44:24.060
I still miss you as ever.

44:24.080 --> 44:27.030
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:27.320 --> 44:29.380
With a gentle heart,

44:29.400 --> 44:32.060
I cherish our remaining years.

44:32.080 --> 44:33.600
Even though we have to go through

44:33.600 --> 44:36.110
all the hardships along the journey,

44:36.240 --> 44:43.430
you always stay by my side,

44:43.520 --> 44:46.190
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:46.480 --> 44:48.560
Year after year in the wandering,

44:48.560 --> 44:51.220
I count the remaining years.

44:51.240 --> 44:53.380
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:53.400 --> 44:55.630
even though we end up the destiny,

44:55.840 --> 44:58.020
I never feel regretful.

44:58.040 --> 44:59.440
In such a chaotic world,

44:59.440 --> 45:02.500
I still miss you as ever.

45:02.520 --> 45:05.630
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:05.720 --> 45:07.860
With a gentle heart,

45:07.880 --> 45:10.580
I cherish our remaining years.

45:10.600 --> 45:12.040
Even though we have to go through

45:12.040 --> 45:14.700
all the hardships along the journey,

45:14.720 --> 45:23.480
you always stay by my side...
